{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:15 2026-11-18 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:15 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:15 2026-11-18 HKT</p><p>陳曉華、龔嘉欣出席TVB台慶拜神活動。陳曉華有兩個跳舞項目，近日積極練舞，笑言每天對住鏡練習，想表現出魅力四射一面。龔嘉欣透露，會同譚俊彥參與幕後致敬環節，惟今次無機會重現《殺手》Dark Angel造型。</p><h2>龔嘉欣翻睇受傷片段眼濕濕</h2><p>龔嘉欣續說：「當時拍動作戲有很多受傷畫面，節目組重播這些畫面，我看到都有眼濕濕，拍動作戲是一個里程碑，今次好期待看劉穎鏇、張振朗、朱敏瀚、周嘉洛的特技動作表演。如果公司需要我做打女，我隨時可以重出江湖。」</p><img alt=\"陳曉華日日對鏡練舞谷魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f01f87da40a66c9562a844e5f28fab6e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_17_18_58.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"陳曉華台慶有兩個跳舞項目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c5fe2528345cd4d88836213104e0592b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_17_19_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"龔嘉欣打女魂未熄等召喚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6eaa4fab3d0caf3a9bb27d1b7a7594ea/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_17_19_01.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"陳曉華、龔嘉欣出席TVB台慶拜神活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a792ca9f0d0225623d2d4c94e696241f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_17_19_02.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"龔嘉欣重睇《殺手》受傷片段眼濕濕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7f1a01f439052911070be5e010aba417/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-18_at_17_19_03_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.745676+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:15:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:35.388030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:23:03.416869+00:00","content_hash":"b9f111f6a6988441834a182faee5b3aca4a1435516821e6f7a25d9be5fe5dd08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}